        ("What is the difference between front-end and back-end PrivateLink in Databricks?", "Back-end PrivateLink connects classic clusters in your VPC to the Databricks control plane. Front-end, also called inbound, PrivateLink connects users, BI tools and API callers to the workspace. You can use either or both; the reference platform uses both."),
